      "content": "Subject: 👋 We Miss You! Unlock Peak Productivity with FlowState CRM ✨\n\nWe noticed you haven't logged into FlowState CRM recently, and we wanted to remind you of the powerful tools waiting for you to maximize your sales efficiency. Imagine leveraging **Automated Lead Scoring** alongside our intuitive **Pipeline Visualization** to see exactly where your deals stand. Plus, streamline your outreach with the **Email Sequence Builder**, **SMS Notifications**, and robust **Customer Segmentation**, all while keeping everything organized with **Contact Management** and **Document Storage**. Don't forget the power of **Task Automation**, **Workflow Triggers**, and comprehensive **Reporting Dashboard**—your entire sales ecosystem is ready when you are!",
      "source": "target",
