      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for this. i see it's hitting a good chunk of the features, but the score is actually a bit lower than I wanted. the marketing team is being pretty strict about \"feature richness\" and they really want to see those numbers go up. \n\ncan you try again? i still want it to feel professional, but don't be afraid to be much more thorough with the list. basically, just make sure every single one of those 20 features is mentioned so we get that max score. i don't want it to look like a random list, but we really need to hit all of them to satisfy the automation tool.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
